l,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Top 5 Government Bonds&quot;}],&quot;label.top_bonds.industry_sector&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Industry Sector&quot;}],&quot;label.top_bonds.maturity_date&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Maturity Date&quot;}],&quot;label.top_bonds.weight&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Weight&quot;}],&quot;label.top_bonds.yield_to_maturity&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Yield to Maturity&quot;}],&quot;label.topholdings.totalofportfolio&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Total of Portfolio&quot;}],&quot;label.us_credit_rating.moody&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Moody&#x27;s&quot;}],&quot;label.us_credit_rating.rating&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Rating&quot;}],&quot;label.us_credit_rating.sp&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;S&amp;P&quot;}],&quot;label.yes&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Yes&quot;}],&quot;label.yielddata.distributionyield&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Distribution Yield&quot;}],&quot;label.yielddata.realyieldtomaturity&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Real Yield to Maturity&quot;}],&quot;label.yielddata.trailing12monthyield&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Trailing 12-month Yield&quot;}],&quot;laddered-buffer.expandable-disclaimer&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;Click here for data point definitions&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;table class=\&quot;disclaimer-table laddered-buffer-disclaimer\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;thead&gt;\n&lt;tr&gt;\n&lt;th&gt;Data Point&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Definition&lt;/th&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;/thead&gt;\n&lt;tbody&gt;\n&lt;tr&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;Tranche Start Date&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;The start date of the Tranche.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;Tranche End Date&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;The last day of the Tranche.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;Initial Reference Asset Value&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;Price of the Reference Asset as of the close of market on the day before the Tranche Start Date.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;Tranche Cap Value&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;The price of the Reference Asset at which the Tranche Cap is reached. The Tranche Cap Value is based on the strike price of the written call options sold in connection with the Tranche. Note that the Fund may not write such call options when they provide limited to no economic value to the Fund and, therefore, the Tranche Cap may at times be greater than indicated.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;Initial Tranche Cap Percentage&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;The percentage increase in the Reference Asset Value (as of the Tranche Start Date) until the Tranche Cap Value is reached, determined as of the Tranche Start Date. This is the approximate upside limit for the Tranche. The Initial Tranche Cap Percentage is calculated as follows: (Tranche Cap Value – Reference Asset Value as of the Tranche Start Date) / Reference Asset Value as of the Tranche Start Date.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;Tranche Buffer Start Value&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;The price of the Reference Asset at which the downside protection from the Tranche Buffer starts. The Tranche Buffer Start Value is based on the strike price of the put options purchased in the set of FLEX Options included in the Tranche.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;Initial Tranche Buffer Start Percentage&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;The percentage reduction in the Reference Asset Value (as of the Tranche Start Date) before the downside protection from the Tranche Buffer starts, determined as of the Tranche Start Date. The Initial Tranche Buffer Start Percentage is calculated as follows: (Tranche Buffer Start Value – Reference Asset Value as of the Tranche Start Date) / Reference Asset Value as of the Tranche Start Date.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;Tranche Buffer End Value&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;The price of the Reference Asset at which the downside protection from the Tranche Buffer ends. The Tranche Buffer End Value is based on the strike price of the options written in the set of FLEX Options included in the Tranche.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;Initial Tranche Buffer End Percentage&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;The percentage reduction in the Reference Asset Value (as of the Tranche Start Date) before the Tranche reaches the Tranche Buffer End Value, and there is no longer any downside protection, determined as of the Tranche Start Date. The Initial Tranche Buffer End Percentage is calculated as follows: (Tranche Buffer End Value – Reference Asset Value as of the Outcome Tranche Start Date) / Reference Asset Value as of the Outcome Tranche Start Date.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;Remaining Tranche Period&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;The days remaining in a Tranche until the Tranche End Date.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;Reference Asset Value&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;The current price of the Reference Asset.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;Remaining Tranche Cap Percentage&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;The percentage change in the current Reference Asset Value until the Tranche Cap Value is reached and is the current approximate upside limit for the Tranche. The Remaining Tranche Cap Percentage is calculated as follows: (Tranche Cap Value – Reference Asset Value) / Reference Asset Value. On the Tranche Start Date, the Remaining Tranche Cap is the Initial Tranche Cap Percentage.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;Reference Asset Value Change to Tranche Buffer Start&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;The percentage change in the current Reference Asset Value until the price of the Reference Asset reaches the Tranche Buffer Start Value and provides downside protection until the Tranche Buffer End Value. The Reference Asset Value Change to Tranche Buffer Start is calculated as follows: (Tranche Buffer Start Value – Reference Asset Value) / Reference Asset Value. At the Tranche Start Date, this is the Initial Tranche Buffer Start Percentage.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;Reference Asset Value Change to Tranche Buffer End&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;The percentage change in the current Reference Asset Value until the price of the Reference Asset reaches the Tranche Buffer End Value. The Reference Asset Value Change to Tranche Buffer End is calculated as follows: (Tranche Buffer End Value – Reference Asset Value) / Reference Asset Value. At the Tranche Start Date, this is the Initial Tranche Buffer End Percentage.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;tr&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;Tranche Weight of the Fund&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;td&gt;The approximate weight of the set of FLEX Options in the Tranche relative to the overall portfolio of the Fund.&lt;/td&gt;\n&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;/tbody&gt;\n&lt;/table&gt;\n\n&lt;style&gt;\n\n.laddered-buffer-disclaimer.disclaimer-table,\n._ws-laddered-buffer-disclaimer._ws-disclaimer-table {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n}\n\n.laddered-buffer-disclaimer.disclaimer-table {\n    font-family: \&quot;ProdFontBLKFortBook\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;\n}\n\n._ws-oneds-richtext-editor-output ._ws-laddered-buffer-disclaimer._ws-disclaimer-table tbody tr td,\n._ws-oneds-richtext-editor-output ._ws-laddered-buffer-disclaimer._ws-disclaimer-table thead tr th,\n.laddered-buffer-disclaimer.disclaimer-table tbody tr td,\n.laddered-buffer-disclaimer.disclaimer-table thead tr th {\n    vertical-align: top;\n    padding: 12px 20px;\n}\n\n.laddered-buffer-disclaimer.disclaimer-table thead tr th,\n._ws-laddered-buffer-disclaimer._ws-disclaimer-table thead tr th {\n    font-weight: normal;\n}\n\n.laddered-buffer-disclaimer.disclaimer-table tbody tr td:first-child,\n._ws-laddered-buffer-disclaimer._ws-disclaimer-table tbody tr td:first-child {\n    font-weight: bold;\n}\n\n._ws-oneds-richtext-editor-output ._ws-laddered-buffer-disclaimer._ws-disclaimer-table tbody tr,\n.laddered-buffer-disclaimer.disclaimer-table tbody tr {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;\n}\n\n._ws-oneds-richtext-editor-output ._ws-laddered-buffer-disclaimer._ws-disclaimer-table tbody tr:last-child,\n.laddered-buffer-disclaimer.disclaimer-table tbody tr:last-child {\n    border-bottom: none;\n}\n\n._ws-oneds-richtext-editor-output ._ws-laddered-buffer-disclaimer._ws-disclaimer-table thead tr,\n.laddered-buffer-disclaimer.disclaimer-table thead tr {\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #333;\n}\n\n._ws-laddered-buffer-disclaimer._ws-disclaimer-table thead tr th {\n    text-align: center;\n}\n\n&lt;/style&gt;&quot;}],&quot;performance-scenario.upper-disclaimer&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The EU Packaged Retail and Insurance-Based Products Regulation (PRIIPs) prescribes the calculation methodology, and publication of the outcomes, of four hypothetical performance scenarios regarding how the product may perform under certain conditions and for such to be published on a monthly basis. The figures shown include all the costs of the product itself, but may not include all the costs that you pay to your advisor or distributor. The figures do not take into account your personal tax situation, which may also affect how much you get back. What you will get from this product depends on future market performance. Market developments in the future are uncertain and cannot be accurately predicted. The unfavourable, moderate, and favourable scenarios shown are illustrations using the worst, average, and best performance of the product, which may include input from benchmark(s) / proxy, over the last ten years.&quot;}],&quot;performance.chart.disclaimer&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;emphasis\&quot;&gt;The figures shown relate to past performance. Past performance is not a reliable indicator of future results and should not be the sole factor of consideration when selecting a product or strategy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Share Class and Benchmark performance displayed in USD, hedged fund benchmark performance is displayed in USD.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Performance is shown on a Net Asset Value (NAV) basis, with gross income reinvested where applicable. Performance data is based on the net asset value (NAV) of the ETF which may not be the same as the market price of the ETF. Individual shareholders may realize returns that are different to the NAV performance.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The return of your investment may increase or decrease as a result of currency fluctuations if your investment is made in a currency other than that used in the past performance calculation. &lt;span class=\&quot;emphasis\&quot;&gt;Source:&lt;/span&gt; Blackrock&lt;/p&gt;&quot;}],&quot;performance.eusd.disclaimer&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The European Union Council Directive 2003/48/EC (\&quot;the Savings Directive\&quot;) places a number of compliance obligations on representatives and agents of iShares as well as certain holders of shares in iShares and entities who may trade the shares of iShares. These obligations became effective within the European Union in two stages, the first was in January 2004 and the second became effective on 01 July 2005. Further similar obligations have been introduced in dependent territories and certain third countries. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The purpose of the European Savings Directive is to enable savings income in the form of interest payments made in one member state, to beneficial owners resident for tax purposes in another member state, to be made subject to effective taxation in accordance with the laws of the latter member state.&quot;}],&quot;performance.returns.average-tab.description&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Definition: Annualised refers to how a return (or other financial metric) is expressed on a yearly basis, even if the actual period is shorter or longer than one year. It allows investors to compare the performance of investments as if they had been held for a full year. Example: If an investment earned 5% in 6 months, its annualised return would be calculated as if it continued at that rate for 12 months, which would be about 10%.&quot;}],&quot;performance.returns.cumulative-tab.description&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Definition: Cumulative refers to the total return on an investment over a specific period, including all gains and losses, without annualising it. It adds up the returns over time, showing the total growth or decline. Example: If an investment grew by 5% in year one and 7% in year two, its cumulative return over those two years would be 12.25% (5% + 7% compounded).&quot;}],&quot;performance.returns.discrete-tab.description&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Definition: Discrete annual returns refer to the return that is calculated for each year individually, rather than over a period of time that includes multiple years. The return is not annualised or compounded, but simply the yearly return for each year. Example: If an investment returns 5% in the first year and 7% in the second year, those returns are considered discrete and separate from each other.&quot;}],&quot;pphero.fees.tagline&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Does it really take money to make money?&quot;}],&quot;pphero.hypothetical.disclaimer&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;p class=\&quot;disclaimer-source\&quot; style=\&quot;font-size: 14px;\&quot;&gt;Source&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=\&quot;font-family: BLKFortItalic; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px;\&quot;&gt;The chart reflects a hypothetical investment and assumes reinvestment of dividends and capital gains. Fund expenses, including management fees and other expenses were deducted.&lt;/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p style=\&quot;font-family: BLKFortItalic; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17px;\&quot;&gt;The performance quoted represents past performance and does not guarantee future results. Investment return and principal value of an investment will fluctuate so that an investor’s shares, when sold or redeemed, may be worth more or less than the original cost. Current performance may be lower or higher than the performance quoted, and numbers may reflect small variances due to rounding. For standardized performance and performance data current to the most recent month end, please view full fund details.&lt;/p&gt;&quot;}],&quot;pphero.hypothetical.tagline&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;span&gt;Curious how an investment could have grown?&lt;/span&gt;&quot;}],&quot;pphero.nextsteps.email.story&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;This fund may be an excellent addition to an investment portfolio. Before investing, it&#x27;s always a good idea to check with your financial advisor to be sure that you are meeting your financial goals.&lt;/p&gt;&quot;}],&quot;pphero.nextsteps.email.tagline&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;Start the Conversation&lt;/p&gt;&quot;}],&quot;pphero.nextsteps.learn-more&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;If you&#x27;re still learning about this fund, download the fact sheet or visit the fund page.&lt;/p&gt;&quot;}],&quot;pphero.overview.tagline&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Is This Fund a Good Fit?&quot;}],&quot;priips-annual-cost-impact-rhp-less-than-1.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Cost impact (*)&quot;}],&quot;priips-annual-cost-impact-rhp-more-than-1.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Annual cost Impact (*)&quot;}],&quot;priips-average-return-year.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Average return each year&quot;}],&quot;priips-compensation.header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;What happens if BlackRock Asset Management Ireland Limited is unable to pay out?&quot;}],&quot;priips-compensation.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The assets of the Fund are held in safekeeping by its depositary, State Street Custodial Services (Ireland) Limited (the “Depositary”). In the event of the insolvency of the Manager, the Fund’s assets in the safekeeping of the Depositary will not be affected. However, in the event of the Depositary’s insolvency, or someone acting on its behalf, the Fund may suffer a financial loss. However, this risk is mitigated to a certain extent by the fact the Depositary is required by law and regulation to segregate its own assets from the assets of the Fund. The Depositary will also be liable to the Fund and the investors for any loss arising from, among other things, its negligence, fraud or intentional failure properly to fulfil its obligations (subject to certain limitations). As a shareholder of the Fund you would not be able to make a claim to the UK Financial Services Compensation Scheme or any other scheme about the Fund in the event that the Fund is unable to pay out.&quot;}],&quot;priips-complaint.header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;How can I complain?&quot;}],&quot;priips-complaint.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;If you are not entirely satisfied with any aspect of the service you have received and you wish to complain, details of our complaints handling process are available at www.blackrock.com/uk/individual/about-blackrock/contact-us. Additionally, you can also write to the Investor Services Team, at BlackRock’s UK Registered Office, 12 Throgmorton Avenue, London, EC2N 2DL or e-mail them at info@ishares.co.uk.&quot;}],&quot;priips-composition-of-cost-header.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The table below shows:&quot;}],&quot;priips-composition-of-costs-footer-astersik-1.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Please refer to the person selling you or advising you about this product for the actual charges.&quot;}],&quot;priips-composition-of-costs-footer-astersik-2.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;This figure is based on estimated costs, often referencing historic data, and therefore the actual costs paid by an investor may differ.&quot;}],&quot;priips-composition-of-costs-footer-header.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;This table shows the impact each year of the different types of costs on the investment return you might get at the end of the recommended holding period and the meaning of the different cost categories.&quot;}],&quot;priips-composition-of-costs-header-subtitle.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;the impact each year of the different types of costs on the investment return you might get at the end of the recommended holding period.&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;the meaning of the different cost categories.&quot;}],&quot;priips-composition-of-costs.disclaimer.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;sup&gt;1&lt;/sup&gt;Not applicable to secondary market investors. Investors dealing via stock exchanges will pay fees charged by stock brokers. Such charges can be obtained on exchanges where the shares are listed and traded, or from stock brokers. Authorised participants dealing directly with the Fund or the Management Company will pay related transaction costs.&quot;}],&quot;priips-comprehension-alert.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;strong&gt;Caution: You are about to purchase a product that is not simple and may be difficult to understand.&lt;/strong&gt;&quot;}],&quot;priips-costs-over-time.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The person selling you or advising you about this product may charge you other costs. If so, this person will provide you with information about these costs, and show you the impact that all costs will have on your investment over time.&quot;}],&quot;priips-costs.header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;What are the costs?&quot;}],&quot;priips-costs.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The person advising on or selling you this product may charge you other costs. If so, this person will provide you with information about these costs and how they affect your investment.&quot;}],&quot;priips-favourable-scenario.label&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Favourable&quot;}],&quot;priips-header.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Key Information Document&quot;}],&quot;priips-if-you-exit-after-rhp.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;If you exit after recommended holding period&quot;}],&quot;priips-if-you-exit-after.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;If you exit after&quot;}],&quot;priips-intended-target-mkt-investor&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The Fund is intended for retail investors with the ability to bear losses up to the amount invested in the Fund (see “How long should I hold it and can I take my money out early?”).&quot;}],&quot;priips-investment.benchmark&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;This type of scenario occurred for an investment in the product with input from benchmark(s) / proxy during&quot;}],&quot;priips-investment.disclaimer&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The stress scenario shows what you might get back in extreme market circumstances.&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The figures shown include all the costs of the product itself, but may not include all the costs that you pay to your broker, financial adviser or distributor. The figures do not take into account your personal tax situation, which may also affect how much you get back.&quot;}],&quot;priips-investment.label&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Example Investment&quot;}],&quot;priips-investment.label.ukpriip&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Investment&quot;}],&quot;priips-minimum.label&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Minimum&quot;}],&quot;priips-minimum.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;There is no minimum guaranteed return. You could lose some or all of your investment.&quot;}],&quot;priips-moderate-scenario.label&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Moderate&quot;}],&quot;priips-month.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;month&quot;}],&quot;priips-months.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;months&quot;}],&quot;priips-other-relevant-info.header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Other relevant information&quot;}],&quot;priips-other-relevant-info.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The benchmark(s) referenced herein are the intellectual property of the index provider(s). The product is not sponsored or endorsed by the index provider(s). Please refer to the product’s prospectus and/or www.blackrock.com for full disclaimer(s).&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The Remuneration Policy of the Management Company, which describes how remuneration and benefits are determined and awarded, and the associated governance arrangements, is available at www.blackrock.com/Remunerationpolicy or on request from the registered office of the Manager.&quot;}],&quot;priips-other-relevant-nopastperformance.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The latest version of this document, previous performance scenario of the Fund, the latest annual report and half-yearly report and any additional information issued to shareholders can be obtained free of charge, in English, from www.blackrock.com or by calling the Investor Services Team on +49 89427295800 or from your broker, financial adviser or distributor. There is insufficient data to provide a useful indication of past performance.&quot;}],&quot;priips-other-relevant-pastperformance-cat1.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The latest copy of this document, the Fund’s prospectus, the latest annual report and any additional information issued to investors can be obtained from your distributor.&quot;}],&quot;priips-other-relevant-pastperformance.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The latest version of this document, fred.fundCompleteCalendarYears year(s) of past performance of the Fund, previous performance scenario of the Fund, the latest annual report and half-yearly report and any additional information issued to shareholders can be obtained free of charge, in English, from www.blackrock.com or by calling the Investor Services Team on +49 89427295800 or from your broker, financial adviser or distributor.&quot;}],&quot;priips-other-relevant-risk-narrative&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Refer to the UCITS KIID or PRIIPs KID for risk disclosures&quot;}],&quot;priips-presentation-of-costs.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The Reduction in Yield (RIY) shows what impact the total costs you pay will have on the investment return you might get. The total costs take into account one-off, ongoing and incidental costs.&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The amounts shown here are the cumulative costs of the product itself, for one or more different holding periods. The figures assume you invest USD 10,000. The figures are estimates and may change in the future.&quot;}],&quot;priips-product-details.header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Product&quot;}],&quot;priips-product-details.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;strong&gt;fred.fundProspectusName&lt;/strong&gt; (the “Fund”), &lt;strong&gt;fred.investorClassCode USD fred.useOfProfit&lt;/strong&gt; (the \&quot;Share Class\&quot;), ISIN: &lt;strong&gt;IE000SNWS0L0&lt;/strong&gt;, is authorised in Ireland and manufactured by BlackRock Asset Management Ireland Limited (the “Manager”) which is part of the BlackRock, Inc group.&lt;br /&gt;The Manager is authorised in Ireland and regulated by the Central Bank of Ireland (the “CBI”) and the CBI is responsible for supervising the Manager in relation to this Key Information Document.&lt;br /&gt;More information is available at &lt;strong&gt;www.blackrock.com&lt;/strong&gt; or by calling &lt;strong&gt;+49 89427295800&lt;/strong&gt;. This document is dated&quot;}],&quot;priips-product-type.header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;What is this product?&quot;}],&quot;priips-product-type.insurance-benefits.label&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;strong&gt;Insurance benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&quot;}],&quot;priips-product-type.insurance-benefits.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The Fund does not offer any insurance benefits.&quot;}],&quot;priips-product-type.intended-retail-inv.label&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;strong&gt;Intended retail investor:&lt;/strong&gt;&quot;}],&quot;priips-product-type.objective-end-disclaimer.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The shares are listed and traded on various stock exchanges. In normal circumstances, only authorised participants may buy and sell shares directly with the Fund. Investors who are not authorised participants (e.g. select financial institutions) can generally only buy or sell the shares on the secondary market (e.g. via a broker on a stock exchange) at the then prevailing market price. The value of the shares are related to the value of the underlying assets of the Fund, less costs (see “What are the costs?” below).  The prevailing market price at which the shares trade on the secondary market may deviate from the value of the Shares. Indicative net asset value is published on relevant stock exchanges websites.&quot;}],&quot;priips-product-type.objective.label&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Objectives&quot;}],&quot;priips-product-type.objective.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The Share Class is a share class of a Fund which aims to achieve a return on your investment, through a combination of capital growth and income on the Fund’s assets, which reflects the return of the MSCI ACWI Screened Index, the Fund’s benchmark index (Index).&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The Share Class, via the Fund, is passively managed, and aims to invest in equity securities (e.g. shares) that, so far as possible and practicable, make up the Index.&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The Index measures the performance of a sub-set of equity securities which are part of the MSCI ACWI Index (the “Parent Index”) which excludes companies from the Parent Index based on the index provider’s environmental, social and governance (ESG) exclusionary criteria. The Parent Index measures the performance of large and mid-capitalisation companies across developed and emerging markets which comply with MSCI&#x27;s size, liquidity and free-float criteria.&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The Index excludes companies which are involved in certain business lines/activities, as set out in the Fund’s prospectus, including: controversial weapons, nuclear weapons, tobacco, civilian firearms, thermal coal-based power generation, fossil fuel extraction, palm oil or arctic oil and gas. Companies that are classified as violating UN Global Compact principles are also excluded from the Index. The Index also excludes companies which do not meet the minimum MSCI ESG Controversy Score to be eligible. Companies may be excluded in order for the Index to reach the level of the reduction of carbon emission intensity relative to the Parent Index set by the index provider.&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The Investment Manager will take into account the above ESG criteria only when selecting the securities to be held directly by the Fund. The Fund may also obtain indirect exposure to securities considered not to satisfy these ESG criteria. The Index is free-float adjusted market capitalisation weighted and rebalances on a quarterly basis.&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The Fund adopts a binding and significant approach to sustainable investing. This means that the Fund will integrate ESG information into its investment process to optimise exposure to issuers to achieve a higher ESG rating compared to the Parent Index.&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The Fund uses optimising techniques to achieve a similar return to its Index. The Fund may use financial derivative instruments for direct investment purposes. The Fund may also engage in short-term secured lending of its investments to certain eligible third parties to generate additional income to offset the costs of the Fund.&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The price of equity securities fluctuates daily and may be influenced by factors affecting the performance of the individual companies issuing the equities, as well as by daily stock market movements, and broader economic and political developments which in turn may affect the value of your investment.&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The relationship between the return on your investment, how it is impacted and the period for which you hold your investment is considered below (see “How long should I hold it and can I take my money out early?”).&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The depositary of the Fund is State Street Custodial Services (Ireland) Limited.&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Further information about the Fund can be obtained from the latest annual report and half-yearly reports of the iShares IV plc. These documents are available free of charge in English and certain other languages. These can be found, along with other (practical) information, including prices of units, on the iShares website at: www.ishares.com or by calling +49 89427295800 or from your broker or financial adviser.&quot;}],&quot;priips-product-type.term.label&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;strong&gt;Term:&lt;/strong&gt;&quot;}],&quot;priips-product-type.term.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The Fund does not have a fixed term of existence or maturity period but in certain circumstances, as described in the Fund prospectus, the Fund may be unilaterally terminated following written notice to unitholders subject to compliance with the Fund prospectus and applicable regulation.&quot;}],&quot;priips-product-type.type.label&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt;&quot;}],&quot;priips-product-type.type.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Fund authorised as a UCITS product.&quot;}],&quot;priips-proxy-disclaimer.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;This type of scenario occurred for an investment in the product and/or benchmark(s) or proxy between :&quot;}],&quot;priips-proxy-favourable.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;This type of scenario occurred for an investment in the product and/or benchmark(s) or proxy between&quot;}],&quot;priips-proxy-moderate.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;This type of scenario occurred for an investment in the product and/or benchmark(s) or proxy between&quot;}],&quot;priips-proxy-unfavourable.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;This type of scenario occurred for an investment in the product and/or benchmark(s) or proxy between&quot;}],&quot;priips-purpose.header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Purpose&quot;}],&quot;priips-purpose.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;This document provides you with key information about this investment product. It is not marketing material. The information is required by law to help you understand the nature, risks, costs, potential gains and losses of this product and to help you compare it with other products.&quot;}],&quot;priips-relevant-risk-narrative-cat1-common&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The actual risk can vary significantly if you cash in at an early stage and you may get back less. You may not be able to cash in early. You may not be able to sell your product easily or you may have to sell at a price that significantly impacts on how much you get back.&quot;}],&quot;priips-relevant-risk-narrative-common&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The actual risk can vary significantly if you cash in at an early stage and you may get back less.&quot;}],&quot;priips-relevant-risk-narrative-rhp-in-month&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The risk indicator assumes you keep the product for 1 month.&quot;}],&quot;priips-relevant-risk-narrative-rhp-in-months&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The risk indicator assumes you keep the product for 5 months.&quot;}],&quot;priips-relevant-risk-narrative-rhp-less-than-1&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The risk indicator assumes you keep the product for 5 year.&quot;}],&quot;priips-relevant-risk-narrative-rhp-more-than-1&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The risk indicator assumes you keep the product for 5 years.&quot;}],&quot;priips-rhp-year.sub-text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Recommended holding period&quot;}],&quot;priips-rhp.header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;How long should I hold it and can I take money out early?&quot;}],&quot;priips-rhp.sub-header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Recommended Holding Period: 5&quot;}],&quot;priips-rhp.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The recommended holding period (RHP) has been calculated in line with the investment strategy of the Fund and the time frame in which it is expected that it will be possible to achieve the investment objective of the Fund. Any investment should be considered against your specific investment needs and appetite for risk. BlackRock has not considered the suitability or appropriateness of this investment for your personal circumstances. If you are in any doubt about the suitability of the Fund to your needs you should seek appropriate professional advice. Details of dealing frequency can be found under “What is this product?”. You may receive less than expected if you cash in earlier than the RHP. The RHP is an estimate and must not be taken as a guarantee or an indication of future performance, return or risk levels. Please see the “What are the costs?” section for details of any exit fees.&quot;}],&quot;priips-risk&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;strong&gt;Be aware of currency risk.&lt;/strong&gt; If you receive payments in a currency that is different to the product&#x27;s base currency, the final return you will get depends on the exchange rate between the two currencies. This risk is not considered in the indicator shown above.&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Please refer to the product&#x27;s Prospectus for details of other materially relevant risks that may apply to this product.&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;This product does not include any protection from future market performance so you could lose some or all of your investment.&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;If the product is not able to pay you what is owed, you could lose your entire investment.&quot;}],&quot;priips-risk-rewards.header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;What are the risks and what could I get in return?&quot;}],&quot;priips-risk-rewards.indicator-higher.label&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Higher risk&quot;}],&quot;priips-risk-rewards.indicator-lower.label&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Lower risk&quot;}],&quot;priips-risk-rewards.indicator.header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Risk Indicator&quot;}],&quot;priips-risk-rewards.perf-scenario-cat2-not.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The scenarios shown are illustrations based on results from the past and on certain assumptions. Markets could develop very differently in the future. This product cannot be cashed in. This means it is difficult to estimate how much you would get back if you cash in before the end of the recommended holding period. You will either be unable to cash in early (or you will have to pay high costs) or make a large loss if you do so.&quot;}],&quot;priips-risk-rewards.perf-scenario-cat2.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The unfavourable, moderate, and favourable scenarios shown are illustrations using the worst, average, and best performance of the product, which may include input from benchmark(s) / proxy, over the last ten years. Markets could develop very differently in the future.&quot;}],&quot;priips-risk-rewards.perf-scenario-common-top.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The figures shown include all the costs of the product itself, but may not include all the costs that you pay to your advisor or distributor. The figures do not take into account your personal tax situation, which may also affect how much you get back. What you will get from this product depends on future market performance. Market developments in the future are uncertain and cannot be accurately predicted.&quot;}],&quot;priips-risk-rewards.perf-scenario.header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Performance Scenarios&quot;}],&quot;priips-risk-sri-1&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;We have classified this product as 1 out of 7, which is the lowest risk class. This classification rates the potential losses from future performance at a very low level, and poor market conditions could affect the value of your investment. This classification is not guaranteed and may change over time and may not be a reliable indication of the future risk profile of the Fund. The lowest category does not mean risk free.&quot;}],&quot;priips-risk-sri-2&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;We have classified this product as 2 out of 7, which is a low risk class. This classification rates the potential losses from future performance at a low level, and poor market conditions could affect the value of your investment. This classification is not guaranteed and may change over time and may not be a reliable indication of the future risk profile of the Fund. The lowest category does not mean risk free.&quot;}],&quot;priips-risk-sri-3&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;We have classified this product as 3 out of 7, which is a medium low risk class. This classification rates the potential losses from future performance at a medium low level, and poor market conditions could affect the value of your investment. This classification is not guaranteed and may change over time and may not be a reliable indication of the future risk profile of the Fund. The lowest category does not mean risk free.&quot;}],&quot;priips-risk-sri-4&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;We have classified this product as 4 out of 7, which is a medium risk class. This classification rates the potential losses from future performance at a medium level, and poor market conditions could affect the value of your investment. This classification is not guaranteed and may change over time and may not be a reliable indication of the future risk profile of the Fund. The lowest category does not mean risk free.&quot;}],&quot;priips-risk-sri-5&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;We have classified this product as 5 out of 7, which is a medium high risk class. This classification rates the potential losses from future performance at a medium high level, and poor market conditions could affect the value of your investment. This classification is not guaranteed and may change over time and may not be a reliable indication of the future risk profile of the Fund. The lowest category does not mean risk free.&quot;}],&quot;priips-risk-sri-6&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;We have classified this product as 6 out of 7, which is the second highest risk class. This classification rates the potential losses from future performance at a high level, and poor market conditions could affect the value of your investment. This classification is not guaranteed and may change over time and may not be a reliable indication of the future risk profile of the Fund. The lowest category does not mean risk free.&quot;}],&quot;priips-risk-sri-7&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;We have classified this product as 7 out of 7, which is the highest risk class. This classification rates the potential losses from future performance at a very high level, and poor market conditions could affect the value of your investment. This classification is not guaranteed and may change over time and may not be a reliable indication of the future risk profile of the Fund. The lowest category does not mean risk free.&quot;}],&quot;priips-risk-summary&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The summary risk indicator is a guide to the level of risk of this product compared to other products. It shows how likely it is that the product will lose money because of movements in the markets or because we are not able to pay you.&quot;}],&quot;priips-scenario.label&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Scenarios&quot;}],&quot;priips-stress-scenario.label&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Stress&quot;}],&quot;priips-type-of-underlying-inv-option&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The Fund is a sub-fund of iShares IV plc, an umbrella company incorporated in Ireland, authorised by the Central Bank of Ireland as a Undertaking for Collective Investment in Transferable Securities (“UCITS”). The Fund is a UCITS exchange-traded fund, a UCITS ETF.&quot;}],&quot;priips-uk.perf-scenario-negative-return.header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;What could affect my return negatively?&quot;}],&quot;priips-uk.perf-scenario-positive-return.header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;What could affect my return positively?&quot;}],&quot;priips-uk.risk-rewards.perf-scenario.header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Investment performance information&quot;}],&quot;priips-unfavourable-scenario.label&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Unfavourable&quot;}],&quot;priips-we-have-assumed-bottom-common-1.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;We may share part of the costs with the person selling you the product to cover the services they provide to you. They will inform you of the amount.&quot;}],&quot;priips-we-have-assumed-bottom-common-2.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;These figures include the maximum distribution fee that the person selling you the product may charge (fred.frontCostPercent % of amount invested/ fred.frontCostAmt USD). This person will inform you of the actual distribution fee.&quot;}],&quot;priips-we-have-assumed-bottom-common-3.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;We do not charge an entry fee for this product, but the person selling you the product may do so up to fred.subscriptionFee%&quot;}],&quot;priips-we-have-assumed-bottom-rhp-less-than-1.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;(*) This illustrates the effect of costs over a holding period of less than one year. This percentage cannot be directly compared to the cost impact figures provided for other PRIIPs.&quot;}],&quot;priips-we-have-assumed-bottom-rhp-more-than-1.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;(*) This illustrates how costs reduce your return each year over the holding period. For example it shows that if you exit at the recommended holding period your average return per year is projected to be fred.grossReturn% before costs and fred.longModerateFelBelAnn% after costs.&quot;}],&quot;priips-we-have-assumed-top-currency.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;USD fred.investmentAmount is invested.&quot;}],&quot;priips-we-have-assumed-top-rhp-less-than-1.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;You would get back the amount that you invested (0 % annual return).&quot;}],&quot;priips-we-have-assumed-top-rhp-more-than-1.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;In the first year you would get back the amount that you invested (0 % annual return).&quot;},{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;For the other holding periods we have assumed the product performs as shown in the moderate scenario.&quot;}],&quot;priips-what-you-might-get-back-after-cost&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;What you might get back after costs&quot;}],&quot;priips-year.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;year&quot;}],&quot;priips-years.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;years&quot;}],&quot;priips.carried-interests&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Carried interests&quot;}],&quot;priips.carried-interests-alt.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;There are no carried interests for this product.&quot;}],&quot;priips.carried-interests.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The impact of the carried interests.&quot;}],&quot;priips.composition-of-costs.header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Composition of Costs&quot;}],&quot;priips.costs-over-time-rhp-less-than-1.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;strong&gt;Costs over time:&lt;/strong&gt; The tables show the amounts that are taken from your investment to cover different types of costs. These amounts depend on how much you invest and how long you hold the product. The amounts shown here are illustrations based on an example investment amount and different possible investment periods.&quot;}],&quot;priips.costs-over-time-rhp-more-than-1.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;strong&gt;Costs over time:&lt;/strong&gt; The tables show the amounts that are taken from your investment to cover different types of costs. These amounts depend on how much you invest, how long you hold the product and how well the product does. The amounts shown here are illustrations based on an example investment amount and different possible investment periods.&quot;}],&quot;priips.entry-costs&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Entry costs&quot;}],&quot;priips.entry-costs-alt.text-ukpriips&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;We do not charge an entry fee.*&quot;}],&quot;priips.entry-costs-alternative.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;We do not charge an entry fee.&lt;sup&gt;1&lt;/sup&gt;&quot;}],&quot;priips.entry-costs.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;of the amount you pay. This is the most you will be charged. The person selling you the product will inform you of the actual charge.&lt;sup&gt;1&lt;/sup&gt;&quot;}],&quot;priips.entry-costs.text-ukpriips&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The impact of the costs you pay when entering your investment.*&quot;}],&quot;priips.exit-costs&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Exit costs&quot;}],&quot;priips.exit-costs-alt.text-ukpriips&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;We do not charge an exit fee.*&quot;}],&quot;priips.exit-costs-alternative.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;We do not charge an exit fee.&lt;sup&gt;1&lt;/sup&gt;&quot;}],&quot;priips.exit-costs.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;of your investment before it is paid out to you. This is the most you will be charged. The person selling you the product will inform you of the actual charge.&lt;sup&gt;1&lt;/sup&gt;&quot;}],&quot;priips.exit-costs.text-ukpriips&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The impact of the costs of exiting your investment when it matures.*&quot;}],&quot;priips.if-you-cash-in-after.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;If you cash in after&quot;}],&quot;priips.impact-on-return-year.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Impact on return (RIY) per year&quot;}],&quot;priips.incidental-costs&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Incidental costs taken under specific conditions&quot;}],&quot;priips.incidental-costs-ukpriips&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Incidental costs&quot;}],&quot;priips.mgmt-fee-and-other-costs&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Management fees and other administrative or operating costs&quot;}],&quot;priips.mgmt-fee-and-other-costs-alt.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;of the value of your investment per year. This is based on estimated costs. Any underlying product costs are included here with the exception of transaction costs which would be included below under &#x27;Transaction costs&#x27;.&quot;}],&quot;priips.mgmt-fee-and-other-costs.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;of the value of your investment per year. This is based on a combination of estimated and actual costs data over the last year. Any underlying product costs are included here with the exception of transaction costs which would be included below under &#x27;Transaction costs&#x27;.&quot;}],&quot;priips.month.april&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;April&quot;}],&quot;priips.month.august&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;August&quot;}],&quot;priips.month.december&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;December&quot;}],&quot;priips.month.february&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;February&quot;}],&quot;priips.month.january&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;January&quot;}],&quot;priips.month.july&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;July&quot;}],&quot;priips.month.june&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;June&quot;}],&quot;priips.month.march&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;March&quot;}],&quot;priips.month.may&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;May&quot;}],&quot;priips.month.november&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;November&quot;}],&quot;priips.month.october&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;October&quot;}],&quot;priips.month.september&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;September&quot;}],&quot;priips.one-off-costs&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;One-off costs upon entry or exit&quot;}],&quot;priips.one-off-costs-ukpriips&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;One-off costs&quot;}],&quot;priips.ongoing-costs&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Ongoing costs taken each year&quot;}],&quot;priips.ongoing-costs-ukpriips&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Ongoing costs&quot;}],&quot;priips.other-ongoing-costs&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Other ongoing costs&quot;}],&quot;priips.other-ongoing-costs.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The impact of the costs that we take each year for managing your investments. Any underlying product costs are included here with the exception of transaction costs which would be included above under &#x27;Portfolio transaction costs&#x27;.**&quot;}],&quot;priips.performance-fee-carried-interest&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Performance fees&quot;}],&quot;priips.performance-fees-alt.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;There is no performance fee for this product.&quot;}],&quot;priips.total-cost.label&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Total costs&quot;}],&quot;priips.transaction-costs&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Transaction costs&quot;}],&quot;priips.transaction-costs-ukpriips&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Portfolio transaction costs&quot;}],&quot;priips.transaction-costs.text&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;of the value of your investment per year. This is an estimate of the costs incurred when we buy and sell the underlying investments for the product. The actual amount will vary depending on how much we buy and sell.&quot;}],&quot;priips.transaction-costs.text-ukpriips&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The impact of the costs of us buying and selling underlying investments for the product.&quot;}],&quot;priips.we-have-assumed.header&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;We have assumed:&quot;}],&quot;product-involvement.disclaimer&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;Business Involvement metrics are calculated by BlackRock using data from MSCI ESG Research which provides a profile of each company’s specific business involvement. BlackRock leverages this data to provide a summed up view across holdings and translates it to a fund&#x27;s market value exposure to the listed Business Involvement areas above.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;br /&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Involvement metrics are designed only to identify companies where MSCI has conducted research and identified as having involvement in the covered activity. As a result, it is possible there is additional involvement in these covered activities where MSCI does not have coverage. This information should not be used to produce comprehensive lists of companies without involvement. Business Involvement metrics are only displayed if at least 1% of the fund’s gross weight includes securities covered by MSCI ESG Research.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&quot;}],&quot;product-involvement.subtitle&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;Business Involvement metrics can help investors gain a more comprehensive view of specific activities in which a fund may be exposed through its investments.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;br /&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Business Involvement metrics are not indicative of a fund’s investment objective, and, unless otherwise stated in fund documentation and included within a fund’s investment objective, do not change a fund’s investment objective or constrain the fund’s investable universe, and there is no indication that an ESG or Impact focused investment strategy or exclusionary screens will be adopted by a fund. For more information regarding a fund&#x27;s investment strategy, please see the fund&#x27;s prospectus.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;br /&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Review the MSCI methodology behind the Business Involvement metrics, using links &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=\&quot;#esg-footer\&quot;&gt;below.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&quot;}],&quot;product-literature.default&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;{type=GLS;material=Fact Sheet}{type=GLS;material=SFDR Web Disclosure}{type=GLS;material=EUPRIIP}{type=GLS;material=KIID~Simplified Prospectus}{type=GLS;material=Prospectus} {type=GLS;material=Annual Report} {type=GLS;material=Tax Information}{type=GLS;material=Semi-Annual Report}{type=GLS;material=Annual Financial Statements}{type=GLS;material=Semi-Annual Financial Statements}&quot;}],&quot;product-page.footer.disclaimer&quot;:[],&quot;product-page.performance.disclaimer&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=\&quot;emphasis\&quot;&gt;The figures shown relate to past performance. &lt;strong&gt;Past performance is not a reliable indicator of future performance. Markets could develop very differently in the future. It can help you to assess how the fund has been managed in the past&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Performance is shown on a Net Asset Value (NAV) basis, with gross income reinvested where applicable. Performance data is based on the net asset value (NAV) of the ETF which may not be the same as the market price of the ETF. Individual shareholders may realize returns that are different to the NAV performance.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The return of your investment may increase or decrease as a result of currency fluctuations if your investment is made in a currency other than that used in the past performance calculation. &lt;span class=\&quot;emphasis\&quot;&gt;Source:&lt;/span&gt; Blackrock&lt;/p&gt;&quot;}],&quot;product-risks-title&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;div class=\&quot;fund-component\&quot;&gt;\n&lt;h2 class=\&quot;mobile-hidden\&quot; data-link-target=\&quot;\&quot;&gt;Key Risks&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&quot;}],&quot;product_structure.physical&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Physical&quot;}],&quot;product_structure.synthetic&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Synthetic&quot;}],&quot;release-testing&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Feb 2019 May 11 2019 DR1&quot;}],&quot;sec-lending.summary.disclaimer&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The above table summarises the lending data available for the fund.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The information in the Lending Summary table will not be displayed for the funds that have participated in securities lending for less than 12 months. The figures shown relate to past performance. Past performance is not a reliable indication of current or future results.&lt;br /&gt;BlackRock’s policy is to disclose performance information quarterly subject to a one-month delay. This means that returns from 01/01/2019 to 31/12/2019 can be publicly disclosed from 01/02/2020.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Maximum on-loan figure may increase or decrease over time.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span&gt;With securities lending there is a risk of loss should the borrower default before the securities are returned, and due to market movements, the value of collateral held has fallen and/or the value of the securities on loan has risen.&lt;/span&gt;&quot;}],&quot;section-headers.cumulative-performance&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;ANNUALISED PERFORMANCE (% USD)&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.annual_performance&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;ANNUALISED PERFORMANCE (% USD)&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.asset_allocation_breakdown&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;ASSET ALLOCATION (%)&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.asset_type_breakdown&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;ASSET TYPE BREAKDOWN (%)&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.breakdown_of_fees_and_expenses&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;FEES AND CHARGES&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.country_breakdown&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;GEOGRAPHIC BREAKDOWN (%)&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.country_long_short_breakdown&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Geographic Breakdown (%)&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.credit_rating_longshort_breakdown&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;CREDIT RATINGS (%)&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.credit_ratings_breakdown&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;CREDIT RATINGS (%)&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.currency_breakdown&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;CURRENCY EXPOSURE (%)&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.dealing_information&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;DEALING INFORMATION&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.discrete_performance&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;CALENDAR YEAR PERFORMANCE (% USD)&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.distribution_information&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;FUND DISTRIBUTIONS&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.fund_characteristics&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;PORTFOLIO CHARACTERISTICS&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.fund_details&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;KEY FACTS&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.fund_performance&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Performance History&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.fund_specific_risks&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;strong&gt;KEY RISKS: &lt;/strong&gt;&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.glossary&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;GLOSSARY&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.index_sector_breakdown&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;INDEX SECTOR BREAKDOWN&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.management_expense_ratio&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;b&gt;Management Expense Ratio&lt;/b&gt;&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.market_cap_long_short&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;MARKET CAPITALISATION (%)&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.maturity_breakdown&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;MATURITY BREAKDOWN (%)&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.maturity_long_short_breakdown&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;MATURITY BREAKDOWN&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.money_market_bond_type_breakdown&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Bond Type Breakdown&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.portfolio_management&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;PORTFOLIO MANAGEMENT&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.preferred_credit_rating&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Preferred Ratings Summary&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.ratings&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Ratings&lt;sup&gt;**&lt;/sup&gt;&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.region_breakdown&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;REGIONAL EXPOSURE (%)&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.region_long_short_breakdown&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;TOP COUNTRIES (%)&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.sector_breakdown&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;SECTOR BREAKDOWN (%)&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.sector_level_summary&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Sector Level Summary&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.sector_long_short_breakdown&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;SECTOR BREAKDOWN (%)&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.top_3_maturity_bucket_holding&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Top 3 Holdings by Maturity Bucket&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.top_5_maturity_bucket_holding&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Top 5 Holdings by Maturity Bucket&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.top_corporate_government_bonds&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Top 5 Corporate/Top 5 Government Holdings&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.top_holdings&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;TOP 10 HOLDINGS (%)&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.top_issuers&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;TOP ISSUERS&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.trading_information&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;TRADING INFORMATION&quot;}],&quot;section_headers.want_to_learn_more&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Want to learn more?&quot;}],&quot;sfdr-art-8&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;p class=\&quot;disclaimer\&quot;&gt;BlackRock Portfolio Managers have access to research, data, tools, and analytics to integrate ESG insights into their investment process. Aladdin is the operating system that connects the data, people and technology necessary to manage portfolios in real time, as well as the engine behind BlackRock’s ESG analytics and reporting capabilities. BlackRock’s Portfolio Managers use Aladdin to make investment decisions, monitor portfolios and to access material ESG insights that can inform the investment process to attain ESG characteristics of the fund.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p class=\&quot;disclaimer\&quot;&gt;ESG datasets are sourced from external third-party data providers, including but not limited to MSCI and Sustainalytics. These datasets include headline ESG scores, carbon data, business involvement metrics or controversies and have been incorporated into Aladdin tools that are available to Portfolio Managers. Such tools support the full investment process, from research, to portfolio construction and modeling, to reporting.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p class=\&quot;disclaimer\&quot;&gt;In addition to having access to these datasets in Aladdin, where applicable, Portfolio Managers could also supplement these sources with sell side research, non-government organization reports, company reported data, fundamental research insights prepared by BlackRock equity and credit investment research teams.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p class=\&quot;disclaimer\&quot;&gt;In order to offer scalable solutions to investors across different asset classes and investment styles, BlackRock has developed a set of exclusionary screens, “BlackRock EMEA Baseline Screens”, that seeks to address a majority of our clients’ requests for exclusions.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p class=\&quot;disclaimer\&quot;&gt;As an example, these exclusionary screens eliminate holdings with more than de minimis exposure to certain sectors/industries including but not limited to controversial weapons, nuclear weapons, fossil fuels, civilian firearms, tobacco, and UN Global Compact violators. BlackRock EMEA Baseline Screens are applied on all new active funds in Europe, Middle East and Africa (“EMEA”), on a comply or explain basis by our portfolio management teams within our product governance structure. For all new sustainable index strategies in EMEA, BlackRock works with the index provider to reflect the same screens in the custom index. Qualified investors with separate accounts can have exclusionary screens set with specific criteria as determined by the investor. The definition of the baseline screens and its adoption into sustainable screened funds is governed by the Sustainable Product Council (“SPC”). The current default ESG data provider for these Baseline Screens is MSCI but investment teams can choose to use Sustainalytics or other custom data sources as required.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p class=\&quot;disclaimer\&quot;&gt;For further SFDR related fund/sub-fund level disclosures, please refer to the fund/ sub-fund specific Investment Objective and Policy section(s) and benchmark information in the prospectus that is available on the website.&lt;/p&gt;&quot;}],&quot;sfdr-art-9&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;p class=\&quot;disclaimer\&quot;&gt;BlackRock Portfolio Managers have access to research, data, tools, and analytics to integrate ESG insights into their investment process. Aladdin is the operating system that connects the data, people and technology necessary to manage portfolios in real time, as well as the engine behind BlackRock’s ESG analytics and reporting capabilities. BlackRock’s Portfolio Managers use Aladdin to make investment decisions, monitor portfolios and to access material ESG insights that can inform the investment process to attain ESG characteristics of the fund.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p class=\&quot;disclaimer\&quot;&gt;ESG datasets are sourced from external third-party data providers, including but not limited to MSCI and Sustainalytics. These datasets include headline ESG scores, carbon data, business involvement metrics or controversies and have been incorporated into Aladdin tools that are available to Portfolio Managers. Such tools support the full investment process, from research, to portfolio construction and modeling, to reporting.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p class=\&quot;disclaimer\&quot;&gt;In addition to having access to these datasets in Aladdin, where applicable, Portfolio Managers could also supplement these sources with sell side research, non-government organization reports, company reported data, fundamental research insights prepared by BlackRock equity and credit investment research teams as well as the BlackRock Investment Stewardship team.&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p class=\&quot;disclaimer\&quot;&gt;For further SFDR related fund/sub-fund level disclosures, please refer to the fund/ sub-fund specific Investment Objective and Policy section(s) and benchmark information in the prospectus that is available on the website.&lt;/p&gt;&quot;}],&quot;sfdr2.subtitle&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;This section provides sustainability-related information about the Fund, pursuant to Article 10 SFDR.&quot;}],&quot;strategy-char.bottom-disclaimer&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;p&gt;The above Strategy Characteristics are provided for illustrative purposes only, are not representative of a specific investment outcome and may not represent current values at the point of any investment in the Fund. The Fund’s position relative to the Approximate Buffer and Upside Cap should be considered before making an investment in the Fund. Shares should be held for the entirety of an Outcome Period in order to benefit from the Approximate Buffer.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The information presented does not take into consideration fees and expenses you may pay including to your advisor, broker or distributor and does not take into account your personal tax situation, which may also affect the return of your investment in the Fund. Figures are shown in the base currency of the share class which is in USD and therefore information provided may not accurately reflect the currency in which investors make an investment into the Fund. Returns may increase or decrease as a result of currency and exchange rate fluctuations.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What you will get from investing in the Fund will depend on future market performance. Market developments in the future are uncertain and cannot be accurately predicted and the above figures are not a reliable indicator of future performance of the Fund.&lt;/p&gt;&quot;}],&quot;strategy-char.disclaimer&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;strong&gt;Important Information: Capital at Risk. &lt;/strong&gt;The value of investments can fall as well as rise and are not guaranteed. The Fund poses a risk of capital loss and investors may not get back the amount originally invested. There is no guarantee that the Fund will be successful in providing these investment outcomes for any Outcome Period.&quot;}],&quot;strategy-char.upper-disclaimer&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;The Fund seeks to reflect the price return of US large cap equities represented by the S&amp;amp;P 500 Index (the “&lt;strong&gt;Reference Index&lt;/strong&gt;”) up to a pre-determined approximate cap (the “&lt;strong&gt;Upside Cap&lt;/strong&gt;”) while seeking to provide a level of downside protection against negative performance of the Reference Index below a certain level (the \&quot;&lt;strong&gt;Approximate Buffer&lt;/strong&gt;\&quot;) when shares are held from the beginning to the end of an outcome period (“&lt;strong&gt;Outcome Period&lt;/strong&gt;”). &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The table below provides the Approximate Buffer and Upside Cap levels at the start of the current Outcome Period together with an indication of the latest available values during the current Outcome Period. The below Strategy Characteristics should be read in conjunction with the Fund’s prospectus, any relevant supplement and the Fund’s KIID/KID (including the risks associated with an investment in the Fund) prior to making any investment.&quot;}],&quot;unregistered_message&quot;:[{&quot;metadata&quot;:null,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;&lt;strong&gt;For Professional Clients Only.&lt;/strong&gt;&quot;}]},&quot;context&quot;:{&quot;productId&quot;:&quot;345063&quot;,&quot;portfolioType&quot;:&quot;ISHARES_FUND_DATA&quot;,&quot;currencyCode&quot;:&quot;USD&quot;,&quot;shareClass&quot;:&quot; &quot;,&quot;aladdinFundTicker&quot;:&quot;ISSAAITTL&quot;,&quot;ticker&quot;:&quot;SAAI&quot;,&quot;appSubType&quot;:&quot;ISHARES&quot;,&quot;locale&quot;:&quot;en_GB&quot;,&quot;targetSite&quot;:&quot;ishares-uk&quot;,&quot;userType&quot;:&quot;individual&quot;,&quot;productPageVersion&quot;:&quot;2026.10.10&quot;,&quot;host&quot;:&quot;https://www.ishares.com&quot;},&quot;services&quot;:{&quot;apiHost&quot;:&quot;https://www.blackrock.com/varnish-api/uk-retail01-product-data/product-data/api/v2/get-product-data?&quot;,&quot;glsDocumentUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.ishares.com/uk/individual/en&quot;,&quot;marketingServiceUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.blackrock.com/varnish-api/marketing-service&quot;}}"></walrus-context><walrus-context contextid="adminData" value="{&quot;isLoading&quot;:true,&quot;componentsByNameMap&quot;:{},&quot;error&quot;:null}"></walrus-context><div><script>
                        if (!window.BLK) {
                            window.BLK = {};
                        }
